      "postType": "liveblog-update",
      "content": "<p>This live page is closing, but our 24-hour coverage of the conflict continues.</p>\n<p>Join us for all the latest developments, analyses and reactions <a href=\"/news/liveblog/2026/4/23/iran-war-live-israel-kills-lebanese-journalist-tehran-us-talks-stalled\">here</a>.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4514965\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4514965\" style=\"width: 770px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-arc-image-770 wp-image-4514965\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ap_69e9530f4f6fc-1776898831.jpg?w=770&#038;resize=770%2C513\" alt=\"This photo released by the Lebanese Civil Defense, show Lebanese Red Cross volunteers and Civil Defense workers carrying the body of the Lebanese journalist Amal Khalil working for the daily Al-Akhbar newspaper killed in an Israeli airstrike, in al-Tiri village, south Lebanon, Wednesday, April 22, 2026. (Lebanese Civil Defense via AP)\" width=\"770\" height=\"513\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ap_69e9530f4f6fc-1776898831.jpg 2827w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ap_69e9530f4f6fc-1776898831.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ap_69e9530f4f6fc-1776898831.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ap_69e9530f4f6fc-1776898831.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ap_69e9530f4f6fc-1776898831.jpg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ap_69e9530f4f6fc-1776898831.jpg 2048w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ap_69e9530f4f6fc-1776898831.jpg 1170w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ap_69e9530f4f6fc-1776898831.jpg 770w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ap_69e9530f4f6fc-1776898831.jpg 670w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ap_69e9530f4f6fc-1776898831.jpg 570w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ap_69e9530f4f6fc-1776898831.jpg 375w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ap_69e9530f4f6fc-1776898831.jpg 270w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ap_69e9530f4f6fc-1776898831.jpg 170w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ap_69e9530f4f6fc-1776898831.jpg 140w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ap_69e9530f4f6fc-1776